{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OID4VCWallet is the wallet side of "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for iOS 15 and macOS 13 and later. It handles SD-JWT VC and ISO mdoc"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Receiving","type":"text"}]},{"text":" them from a Credential Offer (OpenID4VCI 1.0, HAIP 1.0),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the authorization code or the pre-authorized code grant, deferred","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issuance, batches of copies and refresh."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Presenting"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" them in answer to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid4vp:\/\/"},{"text":" request","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"(OpenID4VP 1.0, HAIP 1.0), to Safari’s Digital Credentials API as an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"iOS document provider (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"org-iso-mdoc"},{"text":", ISO\/IEC TS 18013-7), and in","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"person over Bluetooth (ISO\/IEC 18013-5), where the app can also be the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The protocols run in OID4VCgo’s Go code, compiled into the "},{"code":"Mobile","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"framework this package links: every network request, every protocol","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"message and every check on what comes back. Your app supplies the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"platform, through three protocols: a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whose keys never leave"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Secure Enclave, a "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore","type":"reference"},{"text":" under the device’s data","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"protection, and a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" that attests the wallet. It also","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"owns the UI: every session stops where the holder needs to decide.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OID4VCgo is OpenID Certified for the OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"roles under HAIP, over links. The Digital Credentials API and in-person"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presentation aren’t covered by that certification."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Start with "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", then the article for each task;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/IntegrationChecklist","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" lists every step in order."}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCW